//*
# Name a color

The settings of a block are the lines of its header.

    spl run examples/rgb2.spl --human "rgb(0, 0, 128)"
*//

const rgbString = await human('What color is it?');

---
mode: agent
model: gpt-6-luna
reasoning: low

Find the common name for @rgbString.
Don't search the web, give an approximation ->[Str] @colorName
---

success(colorName);
